# Crumb 2: a bread crumb of golden crust (kitchen_crumb), 0.17 m across and 0.1 m tall (60 times life size): the smallest speck, one rounded chunk.
# Ground clutter on the worktop: no collider.
format 1

# A fifth of the vertices its size would give it: a speck
Detail detail=0.11
    Material material=kitchen_crumb
        Translate translation=(0, 0.05, 0)
            Rotate rotation=(0, 0.3, 0)
                RoundBox size=(0.065, 0.05, 0.055) roundness=0.025
